00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:47.927
that the vector search will process
for similarity measurement.

58
00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:52.699
But one key takeaway from post-filtering
and the pre-filtering technique

59
00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:56.703
